ce is complete and coherent for both managed nodes.","limitations":["The demonstration password value was appropriately not captured; evidence confirms that the dedicated secret variable was used and that valid and invalid authentication behaved correctly.","Final source verification rechecked all regular-file contents by SHA-256 but did not repeat the preparation baseline’s complete ownership, mode, and mtime inventory. The complete command trace contains no source-mutating action."]}
